...         NULL Printer Driver for MDEX.          idt       "PRNT-SIO"          copy      "../systemdef/sysdef"          dstk      r10..         Printer control table.          dorg      0.prdvad    bss       2                   printer device addressprcrdly   bss       2                   carriage return delay timeprautolf  bss       2                   cr does lf if nonzeroprvpos    bss       2                   vertical position in page bodyprffdly   bss       2                   form feed delay timeprbody    bss       2                   page body lengthprtop     bss       2                   lines at top of pageprminl    bss       2                   minimum line lengthprhpos    bss       2                   horizontal carriage positionprlfdly   bss       2                   line feed delayprffsim   bss       2                   simulate form feed if nonzeroprbot     bss       2                   lines in bottom margin.          rorg...         Enter here to send data to printer..         LI        R1,<function>.         LI        R5,<buffer address>.         LI        R6,<buffer length>.         LI        R8,<control table address>.         BL        PIOPRTS.         <return>                      R1 = status..         Status:  0 = normal completion.                  1 = I/O error.                  2 = timeout.pioprts*  li	   r0,0	  rt..         Control tables for printers.ut$pr1*   data      0                   device address          data      0                   delay after carriage return          data      0                   cr does lf flag          data      0                   vertical position          data      0                   delay after form feed          data      60                  lines in page body          data      4                   lines in top margin          data      0                   minimum line length          data      0                   horizontal position          data      0                   line feed delay count          data      0                   simulate form feed in software          data      0                   bottom margin length.          end       .